{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41683","headline":"冬日暮旅泊庐陵 · 陈陶","name":"冬日暮旅泊庐陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"螺亭倚棹哭飘蓬，白浪欺船自向东。\n楚国蕙兰增怅望，番禺筐篚旅虚空。\n江城雪落千家梦，汀渚冰生一夕风。\n弃置侯鲭任羇束，不劳龟瓦问穷通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}